  Conv 1     & $16$ & $5\times5$ & $16\times81\times333$ \\
  BN     & $1$ & $-$ & $16\times81\times333$ \\
  ReLU     & $1$ & $-$ & $16\times81\times333$ \\
  Pool 1     & $1$ & $3\times3$ & $16\times27\times111$ \\
